## Bitcoin Core `key_io_valid.json` and `key_io_invalid.json`

`src/core_vectors.zig` reproduces, in full and in file order, the two address /
WIF conformance corpora published by the Bitcoin Core project at
`src/test/data/key_io_valid.json` (70 rows) and `src/test/data/key_io_invalid.json`
(70 rows), fetched from `master` at commit
`e7aef7e86da79000aa42f5ba6d13b0d123d9da7c` (the two files last changed at
`7c200ece80575d399a552f5757c07ac2c8c7ec6c` and
`fa506add25cbe5efbbabca647f5378c4128cf945`). The Zig file is produced by
`tools/gen_core_vectors.py`; its header records the file hashes.

